### FrischMarkt ERP – test requests (REST Client in BAS / VS Code)
@base = http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/erp
@auth = Basic cpi:CHANGE_ME_cpi

### 1. All products
GET {{base}}/Products
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 2. What must be re-ordered?
GET {{base}}/LowStock
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 3. Stock of one store, with product names
GET {{base}}/Stock?$filter=store_ID%20eq%20'S-ESSEN-01'&$expand=product($select=name)
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 4. Create a sales order (like the online shop will do later via CPI)
POST {{base}}/SalesOrders
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalId": "SHOP-0001",
  "store_ID": "S-ESSEN-01",
  "customerEmail": "kunde@example.com",
  "items": [
    { "product_ID": "P-2002", "quantity": 3 },
    { "product_ID": "P-4001", "quantity": 6 }
  ]
}

### 5. Order that must FAIL (not enough salmon) → 409
POST {{base}}/SalesOrders
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalId": "SHOP-0002",
  "store_ID": "S-ESSEN-01",
  "items": [ { "product_ID": "P-1001", "quantity": 50 } ]
}

### 6. All orders with their items
GET {{base}}/SalesOrders?$expand=items
Authorization: {{auth}}

### ─── Phase 4: goods receipt ───────────────────────────────

### 7. Book a delivery: 30 kg salmon arrives in Essen → expect 200, status BOOKED
POST {{base}}/postGoodsReceipt
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "asnNumber": "ASN-TEST-0001",
  "supplierId": "SUP-FISH",
  "storeId": "S-ESSEN-01",
  "items": [ { "productId": "P-1001", "quantity": 30 } ]
}

### 8. Same delivery again → expect 200, status ALREADY_BOOKED, stock does NOT go up twice
POST {{base}}/postGoodsReceipt
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "asnNumber": "ASN-TEST-0001",
  "supplierId": "SUP-FISH",
  "storeId": "S-ESSEN-01",
  "items": [ { "productId": "P-1001", "quantity": 30 } ]
}

### 9. Wrong supplier for salmon → expect 400
POST {{base}}/postGoodsReceipt
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "asnNumber": "ASN-TEST-0002",
  "supplierId": "SUP-VEG",
  "storeId": "S-ESSEN-01",
  "items": [ { "productId": "P-1001", "quantity": 3 } ]
}

### 10. Check: salmon in Essen is now 36, and the receipt is visible
GET {{base}}/Stock?$filter=store_ID%20eq%20'S-ESSEN-01'%20and%20product_ID%20eq%20'P-1001'
Authorization: {{auth}}

###
GET {{base}}/GoodsReceipts?$expand=items
Authorization: {{auth}}
